    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>The Flight Suit is a one-piece coverall (plus a helmet) that provides life support, protects the wearer from hostile environments, and prevents the wearer from succumbing to the adverse effects of high-velocity flying. A Flight Suit includes a matching helmet and gloves that seal around the wearer and provides up to 10 hours of life support. </p><p>As long as you have life support remaining, you are immune to any hostile atmosphere or inhaled <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a> hazard. The suit also grants a +1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>. </p>",
